	quest.1F46A9F08772590E.title: "Refined Obsidian"
	quest.1F7BC81F3DAAF8B6.quest_desc: [
		"Every Mekanism machine has a side config tab on the left of its GUI. Each color is a slot: red is input, blue is output, and so on."
		""
		"Click a side to cycle it, and turn on §aAuto-eject§r to push output into the next machine for free."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 16 x Basic Mechanical Pipe and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1F7BC81F3DAAF8B6.title: "Machine Sides"
